  "description": "Scans a Docker image with Trivy for vulnerabilities in OS packages and language dependencies, misconfiguration, exposed secrets, and licence violations, emitting SARIF, CycloneDX, or SPDX output. Use when scanning or gating a specific image, wiring an image scan into CI/CD, or checking an image during an incident investigation. Keywords: Trivy, image scan, --severity, --exit-code, SARIF, ignore file, .trivyignore. Do not use for cluster-wide scanning or non-image targets - use performing-container-security-scanning-with-trivy; when the toolchain is Grype use scanning-container-images-with-grype.",
